<view class="page"><view class="title">{{reservationId?'修改预约':'预约设备'}} #{{id}}</view><view class="muted">所有时间按手机本地时区显示，使用 30 分钟时段；冲突时加入候补，不代表预约成功。</view><view>开始日期与时间</view><picker mode="date" value="{{day}}" data-field="day" bindchange="input">{{day}}</picker><picker mode="time" value="{{start}}" data-field="start" bindchange="input">{{start}}</picker><view>结束日期与时间</view><picker mode="date" value="{{endDay}}" data-field="endDay" bindchange="input">{{endDay}}</picker><picker mode="time" value="{{end}}" data-field="end" bindchange="input">{{end}}</picker><textarea wx:if="{{!reservationId}}" value="{{purpose}}" data-field="purpose" bindinput="input" maxlength="300" placeholder="实验用途（最多 300 字）"/><button bindtap="schedule">查询开始日期的占用时段</button><view class="muted">空白时段仅供参考，提交时由服务器检查资格、规则与并发冲突。</view><view wx:for="{{slots}}" wx:key="at">{{item.at}} · {{item.kind}}（30 分钟）</view><view class="error">{{error}}</view><view class="status">{{result}}</view><button type="primary" loading="{{busy}}" disabled="{{busy}}" bindtap="submit">{{reservationId?'提交改期':'提交预约'}}</button><button bindtap="mine">查看我的预约</button></view>
